*.bak.*
*.bak

# AiGameKitLab — outputs de benchmark (GLBs/PNGs de profiling, nunca versionar)
docs/bench_kernel_opts/*.glb
docs/bench_kernel_opts/*.png

# OpenCode agent workspace (local state, plans, evidence, notepads)
.omo/

# GameAssets debug_minimal — assets gerados localmente por `gameassets batch`.
